WEBVTT

00:03:58.654 --> 00:04:00.347
i daju nam stabilno vreme.

00:04:00.347 --> 00:04:02.325
Kako morski led na Arktiku opada

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:04.558
zbog klimatskih promena
i globalnog zagrevanja,

00:04:04.558 --> 00:04:05.908
vreme širom planete

00:04:05.908 --> 00:04:08.234
postaje sve nestabilnije.